      NOT THE OTHER PARTRY HAS BEEN ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGE.
 .
 2. Definitions.
 .
 2.1. Affiliate.  "Affiliate" means an entity that directly or indirectly
