Comment:
 This is the Debian GNU/Linux prepackaged version of the EXT2 file
 system utilities (e2fsck, mke2fs, etc.).  The EXT2 utilities were
 written by Theodore Ts'o <tytso@mit.edu> and Remy Card <card@masi.ibp.fr>.

